hadiths[473]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5026","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Yahudiyon aur Nasraniyon ko Jazeera-tul-Arab se zaroor nikalunga yahan tak ke Musalman ke siwa koi na chhorun."
"5027","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main apne hauz se mardon ko zaroor hankunga jaise ajnabi oont hankaye jate hain."
"5028","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main apni ummat mein se qaumo ko janunga jo qayamat ke din Tihama ke paharon jaisi safed nekiyan lekar aayenge to Allah unhein bikra hua ghubar bana dega. Khabardar, wo tumhare bhai hain, tumhari khaal se hain aur raat mein lete hain jaise tum lete ho; lekin wo aise log hain ke jab Allah ki hurmaton mein tanha hote hain to unhein paamaal karte hain."
"5029","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Allah se is se pehle milunga ke kisi ke maal mein se kisi ko kuch dun baghair dil ki khushi ke; bea to bahami razamandi se hai."
"5030","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah apne bande ki tauba se jab wo us ki taraf tauba kare us mein se aik se zyada khush hota hai jo apni sawari par khule maidan mein ho aur wo us se chhoot jaye jis par us ka khana aur pani ho; phir wo us se mayoos ho jaye aur darakht ke paas aaye aur us ke saaye mein let jaye jabke wo apni sawari se mayoos ho chuka ho. Phir jab wo isi haal mein ho ke wo us ke paas khari ho; phir wo us ki nakeel pakre phir khushi ki shiddat se kahe: Ae Allah, tu mera banda hai aur main tera Rab hun! Khushi ki shiddat se ghalti kare."
"5031","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah apne bande ki tauba se tum mein se aik se zyada khush hota hai jab us ka oont us par gire jabke wo use khule maidan ki zameen mein kho chuka ho."
"5032","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tum mein se aik ki tauba se us se zyada khush hota hai jo apni gumshuda cheez se jab use paye."
"5033","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah bande ki tauba se us shakhs se zyada khush hota hai jo manzil par utre jahan us ki halakat ho aur us ke saath us ki sawari ho jis par us ka khana aur pani ho; phir wo apna sar rakhe aur neend soye; phir jaage aur us ki sawari gayi ho. Phir wo use talash kare yahan tak ke jab us par garmi aur pyas sakht ho jaye to kahe: Main apni jagah wapas jata hun jahan tha aur sota hun yahan tak ke mar jaun. Phir wo apna sar uthaye aur us ki sawari us ke paas ho jis par us ka saman ho: us ka khana aur pani! Pas Allah momin bande ki tauba se is se zyada khush hota hai apni sawari aur saman par."
"5034","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tum par tum se zyada qaadir hai."
"5035","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye angare par chalna qabar par chalne se zyada mehboob hai."
"5036","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye qaum ke saath baithna jo subah ki namaz se suraj tuloo hone tak Allah ka zikr kare Ismail ki aulad mein se chaar azaad karne se zyada mehboob hai; aur mere liye qaum ke saath baithna jo Asr ki namaz se suraj ghuroob hone tak Allah ka zikr kare chaar azaad karne se zyada mehboob hai."
"5037","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye Subhan Allah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah aur Allahu Akbar kehna us har cheez se zyada mehboob hai jis par suraj tuloo hua."
"5038","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye angare ya talwar par chalna ya apni jooti apne pair se gantna Musalman ki qabar par chalne se zyada mehboob hai; aur mujhe parwa nahi ke qabar ke darmiyan hajat poori karun ya bazaar ke darmiyan."
"5039","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurat ka apne ghar mein namaz parhna us ke liye us se behtar hai ke apni kothri mein namaz parhe; aur us ka apni kothri mein namaz parhna us ke liye us se behtar hai ke haweli mein namaz parhe; aur us ka haweli mein namaz parhna us ke liye us se behtar hai ke masjid mein namaz parhe."
"5040","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni rassi le phir subah pahar ki taraf jaye aur lakriyan kaate aur beche aur khaye aur sadqa de, ye us ke liye logon se mangne se behtar hai."
"5041","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni rassi le aur pahar par aaye aur apni peeth par lakriyon ka gathha lekar aaye aur use beche aur Allah us se us ka chehra bacha le, ye us ke liye logon se mangne se behtar hai chahe use dein ya manaa karein."
"5042","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi angare par baithe aur wo us ke kapre jalaye aur us ki khaal tak pahunche, ye us ke liye qabar par baithne se behtar hai."
"5043","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka das auraton se zina karna us ke liye apne parosi ki biwi se zina karne se behtar hai; aur aadmi ka das gharon se chori karna us ke liye apne parosi ke ghar se chori karne se aasan hai."
"5044","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka angare par chalna us ke liye qabar par chalne se behtar hai."
"5045","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se aik ke sar mein lohe ki sui chubhona us ke liye us aurat ko chhune se behtar hai jo us ke liye halal nahi."
"5046","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi subah jaye aur apni peeth par lakriyan kaate aur us mein se sadqa de aur us se logon se be-niyaz ho jaye, ye us ke liye kisi shakhs se mangne se behtar hai chahe use de ya manaa kare. Ye is liye ke upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai; aur us se shuru karo jis ki parwarish tumhare zimme hai."
"5047","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi chalis khara rahe, ye us ke liye namazi ke saamne se guzarne se behtar hai."
"5048","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se aik ka pait peep se bhar jaye yahan tak ke use kharab kare, ye us ke liye sher se bharne se behtar hai."
"5049","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka pait peep se bhar jaye yahan tak ke use kharab kare, ye us ke liye sher se bharne se behtar hai."
"5050","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka apne bhai ko apni zameen dena us ke liye us se muqarrar lagaan lene se behtar hai."
"5051","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Dajjal ke saath jo hai use Dajjal se zyada janta hun; us ke saath do nehrein beh rahi hain: aik aankh se dekhne mein safed pani aur doosri aankh se dekhne mein bharakti aag. Phir agar tum mein se koi unhein paye to us neher par aaye jise wo aag samjhe, phir dubki lagaye phir apna sar jhukaye aur piye; kyunke wo thanda pani hai. Aur beshak Dajjal ki bayen aankh miti hui hai jis par mota nakhun hai; us ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hai jise har momin parhega, likhne wala ho ya ghair-likhne wala."
"5052","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main agle saal tak raha to nawein ka roza zaroor rakhunga."
"5053","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main jiya Insha Allah to Yahudiyon aur Nasraniyon ko Jazeera-tul-Arab se zaroor nikalunga."
"5054","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main jiya Insha Allah to manaa karunga ke Rabah, Najeh, Aflah aur Yasar naam rakha jaye."
"5055","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum jaise tum ne kaha to goya tum unhein garam raakh khilate ho; aur jab tak tum is par raho ge Allah ki taraf se un par tumhara madadgar rahega."
"5056","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main zaroor manaa karunga ke Nafe, Barka aur Yasar naam rakha jaye."
"5057","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Labbaik Haq mabood Labbaik."
"5058","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Labbaik Ae Allah Labbaik; bhalayi to aakhirat ki bhalayi hai."
"5059","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Labbaik Ae Allah Labbaik; Labbaik, tera koi shareek nahi Labbaik; beshak hamd, naimat tere liye hai aur mulk; tera koi shareek nahi."
"5060","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Doodh dene wale ka doodh us ke kharche se doha jata hai jab wo girwi ho, aur sawari par us ke kharche se sawari ki jati hai jab wo girwi ho; aur jo sawari kare aur dohe us par kharcha hai."
"5061","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se apne manasik lo; kyunke main nahi janta shayad apne is hajj ke baad hajj na karun."
"5062","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din haq walon ko haq zaroor diye jayenge yahan tak ke seengon wali bakri se beghair seengon wali ke liye badla liya jayega jo use marti thi."
"5063","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum zaroor un logon ke tareeqon ki pairwi karoge jo tum se pehle thay baalisht baalisht ya haath haath; yahan tak ke agar wo goh ke surakh mein dakhil hue to tum us mein dakhil hoge. Sahaba ne kaha: Yahudi aur Nasrani? Farmaya: Phir kaun?"
"5064","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jawan auratein, parda-nasheen aur haaiza zaroor niklein; wo bhalayi aur mominon ki dua mein hazir hon aur haaiza eidgah se alag rahein."
"5065","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum zaroor jannat mein dakhil hoge siwaye jo inkar kare aur Allah par oont ke bhadakne ki tarah bhadke."
"5066","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har maheene apne haiz ke dinon mein namaz chhor de phir har namaz ke liye wuzu kare; kyunke wo rag hai."
"5067","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum zaroor un logon ke tareeqon par sawaar hoge jo tum se pehle thay baalisht baalisht aur haath haath; yahan tak ke agar un mein se koi goh ke surakh mein dakhil hua to tum dakhil hoge; aur yahan tak ke agar un mein se koi apni biwi se raaste mein mila to tum karoge."
"5068","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye ummat hauz par zaroor bheer karegi jaise oont bheer karte hain jo paanch din pyaase reh kar aaye hon."
"5069","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se aik giroh sharab ko aise naam se zaroor halal karega jo wo use deta hai."
"5070","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni saffon ko apni namaz mein zaroor seedha karo warna Allah tumhare dilon ke darmiyan mukhalifat daal dega."
"5071","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ki aik jamaat Aale-Kisra ke khazane ko zaroor fatah karegi jo safed mein hai."
"5072","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni saffon ko zaroor qayam karo warna Allah tumhare chehron ke darmiyan mukhalifat daal dega."
"5073","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen zulm aur na-insafi se zaroor bhar jayegi; phir jab wo zulm aur na-insafi se bhar jayegi to Allah mujh mein se aik shakhs ko bhejega jis ka naam mere naam jaisa aur jis ke baap ka naam mere baap ke naam jaisa hoga; phir wo use adl aur insaf se bhar dega jaise wo zulm aur na-insafi se bhari thi. Na aasman apni baarish mein se kuch rokega na zameen apni paidawar mein se kuch; wo tum mein saat ya aath theharega; phir agar zyada to nau."
"5074","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen zulm aur ziyadati se zaroor bhar jayegi; phir mere ahle bait mein se aik shakhs zaroor niklega yahan tak ke use insaf aur adl se bhar dega jaise wo zulm aur ziyadati se bhari thi."
"5075","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam ki girhein zaroor tootengi girah girah; phir jab bhi koi girah toote gi log us se agli se chipat jayenge. Un mein pehli tootne wali hukm hai aur aakhri namaz."
"5076","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo raaton aur dinon ki muddat ka intezar kare jo wo maheene mein haiz hoti thin is se pehle ke use wo pahunche jo use pahuncha; phir wo us maheene se pehle namaz chhor de; phir jab wo chhor de to ghusl kare phir kapre se patti bandhe phir namaz parhe."
"5077","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya ka zawal Allah ke nazdeek Musalman shakhs ke qatl se aasan hai."
"5078","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya ka zawal Allah ke nazdeek na-haq momin ke qatl se aasan hai."
"5079","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main ne tumhein sawaar nahi kiya lekin Allah ne tumhein sawaar kiya; aur main Allah ki qasam Insha Allah kisi qasam par halaf nahi leta aur us ke siwa behtar dekhta magar jo behtar hai use karta hun aur use khol deta hun."
"5080","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main duniya se nahi aur wo mujh se nahi; main bheja gaya aur qayamat aage barhne mein hain."
"5081","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lashkar mein Abu Talha ki aawaz hazaar mardon se behtar hai."
"5082","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lashkar mein Abu Talha ki aawaz giroh se behtar hai."
"5083","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shayad tumhare keere tumhein takleef dete hain? Apna sar mundwao, teen din roza rakho, chhe miskeenon ko khilao ya bakri qurban karo."
"5084","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shayad tumhein us ke zariye rizq diya jaye."
"5085","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shayad tum Rifa'a ki taraf wapas jana chahti ho? Nahi, yahan tak ke tum us ki usaila chakho aur wo tumhari usaila chakhe."
"5086","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shayad tum un qaumo ko pao ge jo namaz ghair waqt par parhte hain; phir agar tum unhein pao to namaz us ke waqt par parho aur un ke saath parho aur use nafl banao."
"5087","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shayad qayamat ke din meri shafaat use faida de aur wo aag ke uthle hisse mein kar diya jaye jo us ke takhnon tak pahunche jis se us ka bheja ubhle, yani Abu Talib."
"5088","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shayad un donon se us waqt tak takhfeef ho jab tak wo khushk na hon."
"5089","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sood khane wale, khilane wale, us ke gawah aur likhne wale par lanat ki."
"5090","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sood khane wale, khilane wale, us ke donon gawahon aur likhne wale par lanat ki; wo us mein barabar hain."
"5091","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sharab, us ke peene wale, pilane wale, bechne wale, kharidne wale, nichorne wale, nichorwane wale, uthane wale, jis ke liye uthayi jaye aur us ki qeemat khane wale par lanat ki."
"5092","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne apna chehra nochne wali, apna gireban phaarne wali aur halakat pukarne wali par lanat ki."
"5093","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne faisle mein rishwat dene wale aur lene wale par lanat ki."
"5094","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sood, us ke khane wale, khilane wale, likhne wale aur gawah par lanat ki jabke wo jante hon; aur jorne wali, jurwane wali, godne wali, godwane wali, bhavein ukherne wali aur ukharwane wali par."
"5095","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us mard par lanat ki jo aurat ka libas pehne aur us aurat par jo mard ka libas pehne."
"5096","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne auraton mein mard-numa par lanat ki."
"5097","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne chor par lanat ki jo anda churaye aur us ka haath kata jaye, aur rassi churaye aur us ka haath kata jaye."
"5098","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne bichchhu par lanat ki jo namazi ko nahi chhorta na ghair-namazi ko; use hal aur haram mein qatl karo."
"5099","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne bichchhu par lanat ki jo Nabi ko nahi chhorta na aur ko magar unhein dasti hai."
"5100","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne auraton mein mardon se mushabehat karne waliyon aur mardon mein auraton se mushabehat karne walon par lanat ki."
"5101","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne halala karne wale aur jis ke liye halala ho us par lanat ki."
"5102","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne chori chhupe dafn karne wale mard aur aurat par lanat ki."
"5103","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mardon mein hijron aur auraton mein mard-numaon par lanat ki."
"5104","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne godne waliyon, godwane waliyon, bhavein ukherne waliyon, ukharwane waliyon, khubsurti ke liye daanton mein kushadgi karne waliyon jo Allah ki takhleeq badalti hain par lanat ki."
"5105","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne jorne wali, jurwane wali, godne wali aur godwane wali par lanat ki."
"5106","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Yahudiyon se lade; unhon ne apne nabiyon ki qabron ko masjidein bana liya."
"5107","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Yahudiyon se lade; beshak Allah ne un par charbi haram ki to unhon ne use becha aur us ki qeemat khayi. Aur beshak jab Allah kisi qaum par kisi cheez ka khana haram kare to un par us ki qeemat haram kare."
"5108","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Yahudiyon aur Nasraniyon se lade; unhon ne apne nabiyon ki qabron ko masjidein bana liya."
"5109","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne qabron ki zyada ziyarat karne waliyon par lanat ki."
"5110","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us par lanat ki jo chehre par daagh lagaye."
"5111","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us par lanat ki jo mere sahaba ko gaali de."
"5112","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us par lanat ki jo apne walidain ko lanat kare; Allah ne us par lanat ki jo ghair-Allah ke liye zibah kare; Allah ne us par lanat ki jo bidati ko panaah de; aur Allah ne us par lanat ki jo zameen ke nishan badle."
"5113","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us par lanat ki jo janwar ka uzw kaate."
"5114","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rishwat dene wale aur lene wale par Allah ki lanat hai."
"5115","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein subah ka phera ya shaam ka phera us se behtar hai jis par suraj tuloo hua aur ghuroob hua; aur jannat mein kaman ki muqdar jagah us se behtar hai jis par suraj tuloo hua aur ghuroob hua."
"5116","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein subah ka phera ya shaam ka phera duniya aur jo kuch us mein hai us se behtar hai; aur tum mein se aik ki kaman bhar ya us ke qadam ki jagah jannat mein duniya aur jo kuch us mein hai us se behtar hai. Aur agar jannat walon ki auraton mein se koi aurat zameen ki taraf jhanke to un donon ke darmiyan khushbu bhar de aur un donon ke darmiyan roshni kar de; aur us ke sar par us ki odhni duniya aur jo kuch us mein hai us se behtar hai."
"5117","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand aaya ke Musalmanon ki namaz aik ho yahan tak ke maine irada kiya ke gharon mein mard phelaun jo logon ko namaz ke waqt ke liye pukarein; aur yahan tak ke maine irada kiya ke mardon ko hukm dun jo teelon par khare hon aur Musalmanon ko namaz ke waqt ke liye pukarein."
"5118","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us bande ko uzr de diya jise us ne zinda rakha yahan tak ke saath ya sattar saal tak pahuncha; Allah ne use uzr de diya."
"5119","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe miswak ka hukm diya gaya yahan tak ke mujhe apne daanton par darr hua."
"5120","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par aik aayat utari gayi hai jo mujhe saari duniya se zyada mehboob hai: Beshak ham ne tumhein fatah di, fatah-e-mubeen, us ke qaul tak: Azeem fatah."
"5121","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par aaj raat aik surat utari gayi hai jo mujhe us se zyada mehboob hai jis par suraj tuloo hua: Beshak ham ne tumhein fatah di, fatah-e-mubeen."
"5122","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Abu Musa ko Aale-Dawood ke baajon mein se aik baja diya gaya hai."
"5123","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Abu Musa ko Aale-Dawood ki aawazon mein se diya gaya hai."
"5124","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use Aale-Dawood ke baajon mein se diya gaya hai, yani Abu Musa."
"5125","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Allah mein takleef di gayi aur kisi ko takleef nahi di gayi; mujhe Allah mein daraya gaya aur kisi ko nahi daraya gaya. Aur mujh par tees din aur raat mein se guzre aur mere paas aur Bilal ke paas koi khana na tha jo jigar wala khaye siwaye kuch ke jise Bilal ki baghal chhupaye."
"5126","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Jibreel ne parosi ki waseeyat ki yahan tak ke maine samjha ke wo use waris banayega."
"5127","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ne aisi tauba ki ke agar ahle Madina tauba karte to un se qabool ki jati."
"5128","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ne aisi tauba ki ke agar wo ahle Madina mein se sattar par taqseem ki jati to unhein kafi hoti; aur kiya tum ne is se behtar tauba payi ke us ne apni jaan Allah ke liye de di."
"5129","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne wasee ko tang kar diya."
"5130","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne Allah ki wasee rehmat ko rok diya; beshak Allah taala ne sau rehmatein paida kein aur aik rehmat utari jis se makhlooq jin, insaan aur janwar aapas mein narmi karte hain aur us ke paas ninanwe hain. Kiya tum kehte ho ke wo gumrah hai ya us ka oont?"
"5131","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mujh se qareeb ho gayi yahan tak ke agar main us ki taraf himmat karta to tumhare paas us ke khoshon mein se kuch lata; aur aag mujh se qareeb ho gayi yahan tak ke maine kaha: Ae Rab, aur main un mein hun? Aur maine aik aurat dekhi jise us ki billi noch rahi thi; maine kaha: Is ka kiya muamla hai? Unhon ne kaha: Us ne use qaid kiya yahan tak ke wo bhook se mar gayi; na us ne use khilaya na use chhora ke zameen ke keere-makore kha le."
"5132","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine abhi dekha jab se tumhein namaz parhayi: jannat aur aag is deewar ke qible mein numainda ki gayin; maine aaj jaise bhalayi aur burayi mein kuch nahi dekha."
"5133","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine farishton ko Hamza ko ghusl dete dekha."
"5134","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine aik shakhs ko jannat mein karwat lete dekha darakht mein jise us ne raaste ki peeth se kaata tha jo logon ko takleef deta tha."
"5135","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine apne aap ko Hijr mein dekha aur Quraish mujh se mere safar ke baare mein puchte thay; phir unhon ne mujh se Bait-ul-Maqdis ke baare mein kuch cheezein pucheen jo maine yaad nahi kein; to mujhe aisi takleef hui jaisi takleef kabhi nahi hui. Phir Allah ne use mere liye uthaya ke main use dekhun; wo mujh se kisi cheez ke baare mein nahi puchte magar main unhein us ki khabar deta. Aur maine apne aap ko nabiyon ki jamaat mein dekha: Musa khare namaz parh rahe thay; wo ghungrale darmiyane qad ke shakhs thay goya Shanua ke mardon mein se; aur Isa Ibn Maryam khare namaz parh rahe thay; logon mein shabahat mein sab se qareeb Urwa Ibn Masood Saqafi thay; aur Ibrahim khare namaz parh rahe thay; logon mein sab se zyada mushabeh tumhare saathi thay, yani khud aap. Phir namaz ka waqt aaya to maine un ki imamat ki. Phir jab main namaz se farigh hua to kehne wale ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, ye Malik aag ke maalik hain; pas unhein salam kaho. Phir main un ki taraf mutawajjeh hua to unhon ne mujhe salam mein pehal ki."
"5136","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne mujh se azeem cheez ke baare mein pucha hai, aur wo us par aasan hai jis par Allah use aasan kare: Allah ki ibadat karo, us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, farz namaz qayam karo, farz zakaat do, Ramazan ke roze rakho aur Baitullah ka hajj karo. Kiya main tumhein bhalayi ke darwazon ki rehnumayi na karun? Roza dhaal hai, sadqa khata ko bujhata hai jaise pani aag ko bujhata hai aur aadmi ki raat ke darmiyan namaz. Kiya main tumhein muamle ke sar, us ke sutun aur us ki kohan ki choti ki khabar na dun? Muamle ka sar Islam hai; jo Islam laya salamat raha; us ka sutun namaz hai aur us ki kohan ki choti jihad hai. Kiya main tumhein is sab ke zaabit ki khabar na dun? Apne upar is ko roko, aur unhon ne apni zaban ki taraf ishara kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi, kiya ham us par pakre jayenge jo ham kehte hain? Farmaya: Tumhari maan tumhein guma paye ae Muaz! Logon ko aag mein un ke chehron par un ki zabano ki katayi ke siwa kiya girayega?"
"5137","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaj raat Aale-Muhammad par bahut si auratein phirein jo sab apne shohar ki maar ki shikayat karti thin; Allah ki qasam, tum unhein apne behtareen na paoge."
"5138","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine use jinno ki raat mein jinno par parhi, yani Surah Rahman; wo tum se radd mein behtar thay. Jab bhi main us ke qaul par aata: Phir tum apne Rab ki kin kin naimaton ko jhutlaoge, to wo kehte: Ae hamare Rab, ham teri naimaton mein se kisi ko nahi jhutlate; pas tere liye hamd hai."
"5139","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhare baad chaar kalime teen baar kahe; agar unhein us se tola jaye jo maine aaj se kaha to wo un se bhari hon: Paak hai Allah aur us ki hamd ke saath us ki makhlooq ki tadaad, us ki zaat ki raza, us ke Arsh ke wazn aur us ke kalimaat ki siyahi."
"5140","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne aik baat kahi hai jo agar samundar ke pani se milayi jaye to use kharab kar de."
"5141","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine apni qaum se mulaqat ki aur un mein se sab se sakht jo maine paya Aqaba ka din tha jab maine apne aap ko Ibn Abd Yalail bin Abd Kulal par pesh kiya aur us ne mujhe wo jawab na diya jo main chahta tha. Phir main nikla halanke main apne chehre par ghamgeen tha; phir main hosh mein na aaya magar Qarn-us-Saalib mein tha. Phir maine apna sar uthaya to aik badal tha jis ne mujh par saya kiya tha; phir maine dekha to us mein Jibreel thay. Phir unhon ne mujhe pukara aur kaha: Beshak Allah ne tumhari qaum ki tumhein baat suni hai aur jo unhon ne tumhein jawab diya; aur us ne tumhari taraf paharon ka farishta bheja hai taake tum use un mein jo chaho hukm do. Phir paharon ke farishte ne mujhe pukara aur mujhe salam kiya phir kaha: Ae Muhammad! Phir us ne wo kaha; pas jo chaho; agar chaho to un par Akhshabain mila dun. Maine kaha: Balke main ummeed rakhta hun ke Allah un ki pushton se unhein nikalega jo Allah wahdah ki ibadat karein aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karein."
"5142","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine irada kiya ke aadmi ko hukm dun jo logon ko namaz parhaye phir un mardon ke gharon ko jaladun jo juma se peeche rehte hain."
"5143","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine irada kiya ke Abu Bakr ki taraf bhejun aur unhein aagah karun aur ehad karun ke kehne wale kahein ya tamanna karne wale tamanna karein; phir maine kaha: Allah inkar karega aur momin door karenge."
"5144","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine irada kiya ke use aisi lanat karun jo us ke saath us ki qabar mein dakhil ho: Wo use kaise wirasat deta hai halanke wo us ke liye halal nahi? Wo use kaise khidmat mein leta hai halanke wo us ke liye halal nahi?"
"5145","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine irada kiya ke gheela se manaa karun yahan tak ke yaad kiya ke Room aur Faaras aisa karte hain aur un ki aulad ko nuqsan nahi hota."
"5146","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine irada kiya ke tohfa qabool na karun siwaye Qurashi, Ansari, Saqafi ya Dausi se."
"5147","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ka dil handi se zyada palatne wala hai jab wo ubalne par jama ho."
"5148","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne mayyiton ko La ilaha illallah sikhao."
"5149","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne mayyiton ko La ilaha illallah sikhao; kyunke momin ki jaan paseene se nikalti hai aur kafir ki jaan us ke jabre se nikalti hai jaise gadhe ki jaan nikalti hai."
"5150","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne mayyiton ko La ilaha illallah sikhao; kyunke jis ka aakhri kalaam maut ke waqt La ilaha illallah ho wo zamane mein aik din jannat mein dakhil hoga agarche use us se pehle jo pahuncha so pahuncha."
"5151","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jal ki raah mein saff mein aadmi ka aik ghari qayam saath saal ki ibadat se behtar hai."
"5152","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Ibrahim se mila jis raat mujhe sairaan karayi gayi; unhon ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, meri taraf se apni ummat ko salam kaho aur unhein khabar do ke jannat ki mitti pakeeza, us ka pani meetha hai aur wo khaali maidan hai; aur us ke paudhe Subhan Allah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah aur Allahu Akbar hain."
"5153","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se aik ke kore ki jagah jannat mein aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan se behtar hai."
"5154","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare liye us se jannat mein saat sau nakeel-daar oontniyan hain."
"5155","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare liye us se qayamat ke din saat sau oontniyan hain jo sab nakeel-daar hain."
"5156","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare liye har garam jigar mein ajr hai."
"5157","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare liye wo hai jo tune niyyat kiya ae Yazeed, aur tumhare liye wo hai jo tune liya ae Maan."
"5158","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare liye ae kashti walon do hijratein hain."
"5159","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare liye har haddi jis par Allah ka naam liya gaya jo tumhare haathon mein pade zyada se zyada gosht wali hai; aur har mengni tumhare janwaron ka chaara hai. Pas un donon se istinja na karo; kyunke ye donon tumhare bhaiyon ka khana hain."
"5160","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lekin behtareen aur khubsurat jihad maqbool hajj hai."
"5161","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam mein har aik ke liye zina ka hissa hai: aankh ka zina dekhna hai, zaban ka zina bolna hai, kaanon ka zina sunna hai, haathon ka zina hai aur un ka zina pakarna hai, pairon ka zina hai aur un ka zina chalna hai, munh ka zina hai aur us ka zina bosa hai."
"5162","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har ummat ke liye ameen hai aur meri ummat ke ameen Abu Ubaida bin Al-Jarrah hain."
"5163","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har ummat ke liye majoosi hain; aur meri ummat ke majoosi wo hain jo kehte hain taqdeer nahi. Agar beemar hon to un ki ayadat na karo aur agar mar jayen to un ke janaze mein hazir na ho."
"5164","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har beemari ke liye dawa hai; phir jab beemari ki dawa lag jaye to Allah taala ke izn se sehat ho jati hai."
"5165","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har surat ke liye ruku aur sajde mein se us ka hissa hai."
"5166","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har sahw ke liye salam ke baad do sajde hain."
"5167","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har dagha-baz ke liye qayamat ke din us ke sireen ke paas jhanda hai."
"5168","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har dagha-baz ke liye jhanda hai jis se wo qayamat ke din pehchana jayega."
"5169","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har dagha-baz ke liye jhanda hai jo us ki dagha se nasb kiya jayega."
"5170","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har dagha-baz ke liye qayamat ke din jhanda hai jo us ke liye us ki dagha ke qadr uthaya jayega. Khabardar, aam ameer se bara dagha-baz koi nahi."
"5171","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har daur ke liye aage barhne wala hai."
"5172","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke har daur mein aage barhne wale honge."
"5173","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Nabi ke liye wirsa aur kamzor hain; aur mera wirsa aur kamzor Ansaar hain; pas un mein mera khayal rakho."
"5174","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Nabi ke liye dua hai jo us ne apni ummat mein mangi aur us ke liye qabool ki gayi; aur main chahta hun Insha Allah ke apni dua qayamat ke din apni ummat ke liye shafaat bacha rakhun."
"5175","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Nabi ke liye dua hai jo us ne apni ummat mein mangi; aur maine apni dua qayamat ke din apni ummat ke liye shafaat bacha rakhi hai."
"5176","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Nabi ke liye qabool hone wali dua hai; har Nabi ne apni dua mein jaldi ki; aur maine apni dua qayamat ke din apni ummat ke liye shafaat bacha rakhi hai. Wo Insha Allah use payegi jo meri ummat mein se is haal mein mara ke Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karta ho."
"5177","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Nabi ke liye dua hai jo wo mangta hai; pas main chahta hun ke apni dua qayamat ke din apni ummat ke liye shafaat chhupa rakhun."
"5178","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har Nabi ke liye qabool hone wali dua hai jo wo mangta hai aur us ke liye qabool ki jati hai aur use di jati hai; aur maine apni dua qayamat ke din apni ummat ke liye shafaat bacha rakhi hai."
"5179","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beti ke liye aadha, pote ki beti ke liye chhatha aur jo baaqi rahe behan ke liye."
"5180","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kunwari ke liye saat aur ghair-kunwari ke liye teen."
"5181","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tauba ke liye maghrib mein darwaza hai sattar saal ki musafat; wo aise hi rahega yahan tak ke tumhare Rab ki kuch nishaniyan aayen: suraj ka maghrib se tuloo hona."
"5182","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheed ke liye Allah ke paas saat khaslatein hain: us ke khoon ke pehle qatre mein use bakhsh diya jata hai, wo jannat mein apni jagah dekhta hai, use iman ka jora pehnaya jata hai, bahattar hooron se us ka nikah kiya jata hai, use qabar ke azaab se panaah di jati hai, wo bare ghabrahat se aman pata hai, us ke sar par waqar ka taaj rakha jata hai jis ka yaqoot duniya aur jo kuch us mein hai us se behtar hai aur wo apne ghar walon mein se sattar insaanon ki shafaat karega."
"5183","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rozedar ke liye do khushiyan hain: iftar ke waqt khushi aur apne Rab se mulaqat ke waqt khushi."
"5184","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rozedaron ke liye jannat mein darwaza hai jise Rayyan kaha jata hai; us mein un ke siwa koi dakhil nahi hoga. Phir jab un ka aakhri dakhil ho jayega to band kar diya jayega; jo us mein dakhil hua piyega aur jo piyega kabhi pyasa nahi hoga."
"5185","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naik ghulam ke liye do ajr hain."
"5186","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jihad karne wale ke liye us ka ajr hai aur taiyar karne wale ke liye us ka ajr aur jihad karne wale ka ajr hai."
"5187","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ulti karne wale ke liye shaheed ka ajr hai aur doobne wale ke liye do shaheedon ka ajr hai."
"5188","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ke liye momin par chhe haq hain: jab beemar ho to us ki ayadat kare, jab mar jaye to us ke janaze mein hazir ho, jab bulaye to jawab de, jab mile to salam kare, jab chheenke to jawab de aur jab ghair-hazir ya hazir ho to us ki khair-khwahi kare."
"5189","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musafir ke liye teen din aur un ki raatein aur muqeem ke liye aik din aur raat mozon par masah mein."
"5190","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ke liye Musalman par chaar khaslatein hain: jab chheenke to jawab de, jab bulaye to jawab de, jab mar jaye to janaze mein hazir ho aur jab beemar ho to ayadat kare."
"5191","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghulam ke liye maroof ke saath us ka khana aur libas hai; aur use kaam mein takleef na di jaye siwaye jitni taqat rakhe."
"5192","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghulam ke liye us ka khana aur libas hai; aur use takleef na di jaye siwaye jitni taqat rakhe. Phir agar tum unhein takleef do to un ki madad karo; aur Allah ke bandon ko azaab na do jo tum jaise makhlooq hain."
"5193","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muhaajireen ke liye wapas aane ke baad teen qayam hai."
"5194","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine rone se manaa nahi kiya; maine to do behuda badkaar aawazon se manaa kiya hai: naame ke waqt shaitan ke baaje aur khel ki aawaz, aur museebat ke waqt chehre nochne, gireban phaarne aur shaitan ke cheekhne ki aawaz. Aur ye rehmat hai."
"5195","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yahudiyon ne ham se kisi cheez par hasad nahi kiya jitna unhon ne..... salam aur aameen par hasad kiya, ... ..."
"5196","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum se pehle kaale saron walon mein se kisi ke liye ghanimat halal nahi huin; wo jama ki jatin aur aasman se aag utarti aur unhein kha jati."
"5197","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ki qaum ki zaban mein."
"5198","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabuwat mein se siwaye khushkhabriyon ke kuch baaqi nahi raha: achcha khwab."
"5199","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jhule mein siwaye teen ke kisi ne baat nahi ki: Isa. Aur Bani Israel mein aik shakhs tha jise Juraij kaha jata tha jo namaz parhta tha; us ki maan us ke paas aayi aur use pukara to us ne kaha: Main use jawab dun ya namaz parhun? To us ne kaha: Ae Allah, use maut na de yahan tak ke use bad-kaar auraton ke chehre dikhaye. Aur Juraij khanaqah mein tha; phir us ke saamne aik aurat aayi aur us se baat ki to us ne inkar kar diya. Phir wo charwahe ke paas aayi aur use apne aap par qaabu diya; phir us ne ladka jana to us ne kaha: Juraij se hai. Phir wo us ke paas aaye aur us ki khanaqah tor di; phir use utara, use gaali di. Phir us ne wuzu kiya aur namaz parhi; phir ladke ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae ladke, tumhara baap kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Charwaha. Unhon ne kaha: Ham tumhari khanaqah sone se banayen? Us ne kaha: Nahi, magar mitti se. Aur aik aurat Bani Israel mein se apne bete ko doodh pilati thi; phir us ke paas se nishan wala sawaar guzra to us ne kaha: Ae Allah, mere bete ko us jaisa bana. To us ne us ka than chhor diya aur sawaar par aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah, mujhe us jaisa na bana. Phir apne than ki taraf wapas aaya aur use choosne laga. Phir aik laundi par guzra to us ne kaha: Ae Allah, mere bete ko is jaisi na bana. To us ne us ka than chhor diya aur kaha: Ae Allah, mujhe is jaisi bana. To us ne kaha: Ye kyun? Us ne kaha: Sawaar jabiron mein se jabir hai; aur ye laundi jis ke baare mein kehte hain ke us ne chori ki, zina kiya, halanke us ne nahi kiya."
"5200","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aapas mein mohabbat karne walon ke liye nikah jaisa kuch nahi dekha gaya."
"5201","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Nabi dafn nahi kiya gaya magar jahan wo marta hai."
"5202","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibrahim ne siwaye teen jhooton ke jhoot nahi bola: un mein se do Allah ki zaat mein: un ka qaul ke main beemar hun aur un ka qaul ke balke ye un ke bare ne kiya hai. Aur jab wo aik din Sara ke saath thay ke jabiron mein se aik jabir par guzre to us se kaha gaya: Yahan aik shakhs hai jis ke saath logon mein sab se khubsurat aurat hai. Phir us ne us ki taraf bheja aur us se us ke baare mein pucha aur kaha: Ye kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Meri behan. Phir wo Sara ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Sara, zameen ke chehre par mere aur tumhare siwa koi momin nahi; aur is ne mujh se sawal kiya to maine use khabar di ke tum meri behan ho; pas mujhe na jhutlana. Phir us ne us ki taraf bheja; phir jab wo us ke paas dakhil hui to us ne apne haath se use pakarne ka irada kiya to pakra gaya. To us ne kaha: Mere liye Allah se dua karo aur main tumhein nuqsan nahi pahunchaunga. Phir us ne Allah se dua ki to chhor diya gaya. Phir us ne doosri baar use pakra to us jaisa ya us se sakht pakra gaya. To us ne kaha: Mere liye Allah se dua karo aur main tumhein nuqsan nahi pahunchaunga. Phir us ne dua ki to chhor diya gaya. Phir us ne apne darbanon mein se aik ko bulaya aur kaha: Tum mere paas insaan nahi laye! Tum mere paas to shaitan laye ho! Phir us ne use Hajira khidmat mein di; phir wo us ke paas aayi halanke wo khare namaz parh rahe thay; to unhon ne apne haath se ishara kiya ke kiya bana? Us ne kaha: Allah ne badkaar ke fareb ko us ki gardan mein lauta diya aur Hajira khidmat mein di."
"5203","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ne jhoot nahi bola jo do ke darmiyan sulah ke liye chughli kare."
"5204","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum apne maalon ki zakaat nahi rokti magar un se aasman ki baarish roki jati hai; aur agar janwar na hote to baarish na hoti."
"5205","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Uhud mein tumhare bhai shaheed hue to Allah ne un ki roohon ko sabz parindon ke pait mein kar diya jo jannat ki nehron par aate hain, us ke phalon se khate hain aur Arsh ke saaye mein latke hue sone ke qandeelon mein rehte hain. Phir jab unhon ne apne khane, peene aur aaraam ki umdagi payi to unhon ne kaha: Kaun hamari taraf se hamare bhaiyon ko pahunchayega ke ham jannat mein zinda hain, rizq diye jate hain, taake wo jihad se be-raghbati na karein aur ladayi ke waqt susti na karein? To Allah taala ne farmaya: Main tumhari taraf se unhein pahunchata hun."
"5206","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne Firaun ko duboya to us ne kaha: Main iman laya ke us ke siwa koi mabood nahi jis par Bani Israel iman laye. Jibreel ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Kaash tum mujhe dekhte jab main samundar ki mitti leta aur us ke munh mein thonsta is darr se ke use rehmat pa le."
"5207","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Adam wafat pa gaye to farishton ne unhein taaq pani se ghusl diya aur un ke liye lahad banayi; aur kaha: Ye Adam ki sunnat hai un ki aulad mein."
"5208","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne Adam ko paida kiya to un ki peeth par haath phera aur un ki peeth se har jaan gir padi jise wo qayamat ke din tak paida karne wala hai. Phir un mein se har insaan ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan noor ki chamak rakhi; phir unhein Adam par pesh kiya to unhon ne kaha: Ae Rab, ye kaun hain? Farmaya: Ye tumhari aulad hain. Phir unhon ne un mein se aik shakhs dekha jis ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan noor ne unhein khush kiya; to unhon ne kaha: Ae Rab, ye kaun hai? Farmaya: Tumhari aulad mein se aik shakhs jo aakhri ummaton mein hoga jise Dawood kaha jata hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rab, us ki umar kitni hai? Farmaya: Saath saal. Unhon ne kaha: Us mein meri umar mein se chalis saal zyada kar de. Farmaya: Phir likha jayega, muhar lagegi aur badla nahi jayega. Phir jab Adam ki umar poori hui to malak-ul-maut aaya to unhon ne kaha: Kiya meri umar mein se chalis saal baaqi nahi rahe? Us ne kaha: Kiya tum ne apne bete Dawood ko nahi diye? Phir us ki aulad ne inkar kiya, Adam bhoole to us ki aulad bhooli aur Adam ne khata ki to us ki aulad ne khata ki."
"5209","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne Adam ko paida kiya aur un mein rooh phoonki to unhein chheenk aayi to unhon ne kaha: Alhamdulillah; phir us ke izn se Allah ki hamd ki. To un ke Rab ne un se farmaya: Allah tum par rehem kare ae Adam! Un farishton ke paas jao jo un mein se majlis mein baithe hain aur kaho: Tum par salamti ho. Unhon ne kaha: Aur tum par salamti aur Allah ki rehmat. Phir wo apne Rab ki taraf wapas aaye to us ne farmaya: Ye tumhara aur tumhare beton ke darmiyan tohfa hai. Phir Allah ne un se farmaya halanke us ke donon haath band thay: Jo chaho ikhtiyar karo. Unhon ne kaha: Maine apne Rab ka dayen ikhtiyar kiya; aur mere Rab ke donon haath dayen barkat wale hain. Phir us ne use khola to us mein Adam aur un ki aulad thay. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Rab, ye kaun hain? Farmaya: Ye tumhari aulad hain. Phir har insaan ki umar us ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan likhi hui thi; phir un mein aik shakhs tha jo un mein sab se roshan tha ya sab se roshanon mein se. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rab, ye kaun hai? Farmaya: Ye tumhara beta Dawood hai jis ke liye chalis saal ki umar likhi gayi hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rab, us ki umar mein zyada kar de. Farmaya: Yehi hai jo us ke liye likha gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rab, maine us ke liye apni umar mein se saath saal kar diye hain. Farmaya: Tum aur wo. Phir use jannat mein tehraya jitna Allah ne chaha; phir us se utara gaya. Phir Adam apne aap ko ginte thay; phir un ke paas malak-ul-maut aaya to Adam ne us se kaha: Tum ne jaldi ki; mere liye hazaar saal likhe gaye thay. Us ne kaha: Kyun, lekin tum ne apne bete Dawood ke liye saath saal kar diye thay. Phir us ne inkar kiya to us ki aulad ne inkar kiya, wo bhoola to us ki aulad bhooli; pas us din se likhne aur gawahon ka hukm diya gaya."
"5210","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne jannat paida ki to Jibreel se kaha: Jao aur use dekho. Phir wo gaya aur use dekha phir aaya aur kaha: Ae Rab, teri izzat ki qasam, jo us ke baare mein sunega wo us mein dakhil hoga. Phir use na-pasandeeda cheezon se gher diya; phir kaha: Ae Jibreel, jao aur use dekho. Phir wo gaya aur use dekha phir aaya aur kaha: Ae Rab, teri izzat ki qasam, mujhe darr hua ke koi us mein dakhil nahi hoga. Phir jab Allah ne aag paida ki to kaha: Ae Jibreel, jao aur use dekho. Phir wo gaya aur use dekha phir aaya aur kaha: Teri izzat ki qasam, jo us ke baare mein sunega wo us mein dakhil hoga. Phir use khwahishon se gher diya; phir kaha: Ae Jibreel, jao aur use dekho. Phir wo gaya aur use dekha aur kaha: Ae Rab, teri izzat ki qasam, mujhe darr hua ke koi baaqi nahi rahega magar us mein dakhil hoga."
"5211","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala ne Adam ko jannat mein tasweer di to use chhor diya jitna chaha ke chhore; phir Iblees us ke gird phirne laga aur use dekhne laga. Phir jab us ne use khokhla dekha to jana ke wo aisi takhleeq hai jo qaabu nahi rakhti."
"5212","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mujhe upar le jaya gaya to maine Idrees ko chauthe aasman mein dekha."
"5213","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mujhe mere Rab azza wa jal ne upar le jaya to main aik qaum par guzra jin ke taanbe ke nakhun thay jin se wo apne chehre aur seene nochte thay. Maine kaha: Ye kaun hain ae Jibreel? Unhon ne kaha: Ye wo hain jo logon ka gosht khate hain aur un ki izzaton mein parte hain."
"5214","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne makhlooq ka faisla kiya to apni kitab mein likha jo us ke paas Arsh ke upar hai: Beshak meri rehmat mere ghusse par ghalib aayi."
"5215","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Quraish ne mujhe jhutlaya jab mujhe Bait-ul-Maqdis ki sairaan karayi gayi to main Hijr mein khara hua aur Allah ne mere liye Bait-ul-Maqdis ko khol diya; phir main unhein us ki nishaniyon ki khabar deta raha halanke main use dekh raha tha."
"5216","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Adam mein rooh phoonki gayi to wo hili aur uri aur us ke sar mein chali gayi; phir unhein chheenk aayi to unhon ne kaha: Sab taareef Allah ke liye jo jahano ka Rab hai. To Allah ne farmaya: Allah tum par rehem kare."
"5217","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum Allah ke nazdeek us se zyada pohnchi hui cheez nahi parhoge: Kaho ke main Subah ke Rab ki panah mangta hun."
"5218","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hijrat munqata nahi hogi jab tak kafiron se ladai ho."
"5219","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Log nahi hatenge sawal karte hue: Ye Allah hai har cheez ka khaliq, to Allah ko kis ne paida kiya?"
"5220","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye deen qayam nahi hatega; Musalmanon mein se aik jamaat us par ladti rahegi yahan tak ke qayamat qayam ho."
"5221","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala is ummat par do talwarein jama nahi karega: un mein se talwar aur un ke dushman mein se talwar."
"5222","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ko us ka amal jannat mein dakhil nahi karega aur na mujhe, siwaye is ke ke Allah mujhe apni rehmat ke fazl se dhaanp le. Pas durust raho, darmiyani raah ikhtiyar karo aur tum mein se koi maut ki tamanna na kare: ya naik ho to shayad bhalayi mein zyada ho, ya bura ho to shayad wo uzr kare."
"5223","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag mein wo shakhs dakhil nahi hoga jo Badr aur Hudaibiya mein hazir hua."
"5224","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah is ummat ko aadhe din se aajiz nahi karega."
"5225","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo qaum kamyaab nahi hogi jis ne apna muamla aurat ko supurd kiya."
"5226","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Buland darjon mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jo kahaanat kare, qura dale ya safar se bad-shaguni lekar wapas aaye."
"5227","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jo Badr ya Baiat-ur-Rizwan mein hazir hua."
"5228","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jo suraj tuloo hone se pehle aur ghuroob hone se pehle namaz parhe."
"5229","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ko us ka amal nijaat nahi dega aur na mujhe, siwaye is ke ke Allah mujhe apni rehmat se dhaanp le. Lekin durust raho, darmiyani raah ikhtiyar karo, subah chalo, shaam chalo, raat ke aakhri hisse mein kuch aur darmiyani raah darmiyani raah, tum pahunch jao ge."
"5230","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda qayamat ke din is haal mein nahi aayega ke kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi jis se wo Allah ka chehra chahe magar Allah ne us par aag haram ki."
"5231","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Log halak nahi honge yahan tak ke apne aap se uzr karein."
"5232","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din dagha-baz ka jhanda us ke sireen ke paas hai."
"5233","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Yahudiyon mein se das mujh par iman layen to Yahudi mujh par iman layenge."
"5234","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum us ki khaal lo to use pani aur keekar paak karega."
"5235","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum khata karo yahan tak ke tumhari khataen aasman tak pahunch jayen phir tauba karo to Allah tum par tauba karega."
"5236","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main us se zyada subah karun to un donon ko parhunga, behtar karunga aur khubsurat karunga, yani Fajr ki do rakatein."
"5237","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum use apne mamuon ko detin to tumhare ajr ke liye bara hota."
"5238","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar koi qabar ke dabao se bachta to ye bachcha bachta."
"5239","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main kisi ko hukm deta ke kisi ko sajda kare to aurat ko hukm deta ke apne shohar ko sajda kare. ... ..."
"5240","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Ibn Adam apne rizq se bhaage jaise wo maut se bhaagta hai to us ka rizq use pa lega jaise use maut pa leti hai."
"5241","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum mein se koi jab apne ghar walon ke paas aane ka irada kare to kahe: Allah ke naam se; ae Allah, hamein shaitan se door rakh aur shaitan ko us se door rakh jo tune hamein diya. Kyunke agar un donon ke darmiyan aulad ka faisla ho jaye to use shaitan kabhi nuqsan nahi pahunchaega."
"5242","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum mein se koi jab manzil par utre to kahe: Main Allah ke mukammal kalimaat ki panah mangta hun us ke shar se jo us ne paida kiya, to use us manzil mein koi cheez nuqsan nahi pahunchaegi yahan tak ke us se kooch kare."
"5243","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar bande gunah na karte to Allah aisi makhlooq paida karta jo gunah karte phir bakhshish mangte phir wo unhein bakhsh deta; aur wo bakhshne wala rehem wala hai."
"5244","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Allah apne aasmanon aur zameen walon ko azaab de to unhein azaab dega halanke wo un par zaalim nahi; aur agar un par rehem kare to us ki rehmat un ke liye un ke aamaal se behtar hogi. Aur agar tum Uhud jaisa sona Allah ki raah mein kharch karo to Allah tum se qabool nahi karega yahan tak ke taqdeer par iman lao; phir jano ke jo tumhein pahuncha wo tum se khata karne wala na tha aur jo tum se khata hua wo tumhein pahunchne wala na tha. Aur agar tum is ke siwa par mare to aag mein dakhil hoge."
"5245","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar wo pani jis se bachcha hota hai use chattan par baha de to Allah taala us mein se bachcha nikalega; aur Allah zaroor aisi jaan paida karega jise wo paida karne wala hai."
"5246","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar koi shakhs tum par baghair ijazat ke jhanke aur tum use kankari se maro aur us ki aankh phor do to tum par gunah nahi."
"5247","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar aasman aur zameen wale momin ke khoon mein shareek hon to Allah azza wa jal unhein aag mein daal dega."
"5248","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar saat haamila oontniyon jaisa pathar jahannam ke kinare se phenka jaye to us mein sattar saal girta rahe aur us ki teh tak na pahunche."
"5249","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar koi shakhs apne munh par ghisat-ta hua us din se jab paida hua us din tak jab burha ho kar mare Allah taala ki raza mein chale to qayamat ke din use haqeer samjhega."
"5250","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar zaqqoom ka aik qatra duniya ke ghar mein tapke to duniya walon ki guzran kharab kar de; phir us ka kiya haal hoga jis ka khana wo ho?"
"5251","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar jannat mein se nakhun bhar cheez zahir ho to aasmanon aur zameen ke darmiyan us se saj jaye; aur agar jannat walon mein se koi shakhs jhanke aur us ke kanghan zahir hon to suraj ki roshni ko mita de jaise suraj sitaron ki roshni ko mitata hai."
"5252","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum jab mere paas se niklo us haal mein ho jis haal mein hote ho to farishte Madina ke raston mein tum se musafaha karein."
"5253","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum har haal mein us haalat par ho jis par mere paas ho to farishte apni hatheliyon se tum se musafaha karein aur tumhare gharon mein tumhari ziyarat karein. Aur agar tum gunah na karo to Allah aisi qaum le aaye jo gunah karein taake unhein bakhsh de."
"5254","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum Allah taala par us ke tawakkul ka haq ada karte hue tawakkul karo to tumhein aise rizq de jaise parinde ko deta hai jo subah bhooka nikalta hai aur shaam pait bhar kar lautta hai."
"5255","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main apne muamle mein us ka isteqbal karun jo maine peeche chhora to qurbani na laata aur use umrah banata; pas tum mein se jis ke paas qurbani na ho wo halal ho aur use umrah banaye."
"5256","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main apne muamle mein us ka isteqbal karun jo maine peeche chhora to qurbani na laata; aur agar mere saath qurbani na hoti to halal ho jata."
"5257","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe paya tohfe mein diya jaye to qabool karunga aur agar us par bulaya jaun to jawab dunga."
"5258","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaash ham ye darwaza auraton ke liye chhor dein."
"5259","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar aurat shohar ka haq janti to na baithe jab us ka nashta aur isha hazir ho yahan tak ke wo us se farigh ho."
"5260","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum Allah ki rehmat ka qadr jante to us par bharosa karte."
"5261","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum jante jo tumhare liye zakheera kiya gaya hai to jo tum se rok liya gaya us par gham na karte."
"5262","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum jante jo main janta hun to bahut rote aur kam hanste aur maidano ki taraf nikalte Allah taala se girya karte hue......... ..."
"5263","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum jante jo main janta hun to kam hanste aur zyada rote."
"5264","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum jante jo pehli saff mein hai to qura ke siwa kuch na hota."
"5265","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum jante jo tumhare liye Allah ke paas hai to pasand karte ke faqr aur hajat mein zyada ho."
"5266","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Quran chamre mein jama kiya jaye to Allah use aag se na jalaye."
"5267","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum hamare oonton ki taraf niklo aur un ke doodh aur peshaab se piyo."
"5268","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main dast ya paye par bulaya jaun to jawab dunga; aur agar mujhe dast ya paya tohfe mein diya jaye to qabool karunga."
"5269","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar wo mujh se qareeb hota to farishte use tukre tukre noch lete, yani Abu Jahl."
"5270","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaash tum mujhe dekhte jab main kal raat tumhari qiraat sun raha tha; tumhein Aale-Dawood ke baajon mein se baja diya gaya hai."
"5271","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main kisi ko baghair gawah ke sangsar karta to ise sangsar karta."
"5272","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Ibrahim zinda rehte to siddiq Nabi hote."
"5273","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main janta ke tum dekh rahe ho to us se tumhari aankh mein chubhota; ijazat to nazar ke liye banayi gayi hai."
"5274","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tumhein bakhsh diya jaye jo tum janwaron ke saath karte ho to tumhein bahut bakhsh diya jayega."
"5275","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar muqaddar hota to hota."
"5276","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum kehte: Allah ke naam se, to farishte tumhein uthate jabke log tumhein dekh rahe hote yahan tak ke tumhein aasman ki fiza mein le jate."
"5277","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main kehta haan to wajib ho jata; aur agar wajib ho jata to tum us par qayam na rakhte; aur agar tum us par qayam na rakhte to azaab diye jate."
"5278","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum use kehte jab tum apne muamle ke maalik thay to poori kamyabi pate."
"5279","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Usama ladki hoti to use kapre pehnata aur zewar pehnata yahan tak ke use kharch karta."
"5280","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar iman Surayya par hota to Faaras ke mard use pa lete."
"5281","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar iman Surayya par hota to Faaras ke beton mein se aadmi use le jata yahan tak ke use pa leta."
"5282","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Quran chamre mein hota to aag use na khaati."
"5283","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Mutim bin Adi zinda hota phir mujh se in gande logon ke baare mein baat karta to main unhein us ke liye chhor deta, yani Badr ke qaidi."
"5284","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mere baad Nabi hota to Umar bin Khattab hote."
"5285","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar wo nuqsan-deh hota to Faaras aur Room ko nuqsan deta, yani gheela."
"5286","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar koi cheez taqdeer se aage barhne wali hoti to nazar us se aage barhti."
"5287","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar koi cheez taqdeer se aage barhne wali hoti to nazar us se aage barhti; aur jab tum se ghusl manga jaye to ghusl karo."
"5288","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Ibn Adam ke paas maal ki wadi ho to wo us ki taraf doosri chahega; aur agar us ke paas do wadiyan hon to wo un ke liye teesri chahega. Aur Ibn Adam ka pait mitti ke siwa kuch nahi bharta; aur Allah us par tauba karta hai jo tauba kare."
"5289","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Ibn Adam ke paas khajoor ki wadi ho to wo us jaisi tamanna karega, phir us jaisi tamanna karega yahan tak ke wadiyon ki tamanna karega. Aur Ibn Adam ka pait mitti ke siwa kuch nahi bharta."
"5290","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mere paas Uhud jaisa sona hota to mujhe khush karta ke mujh par teen guzrein aur mere paas us mein se kuch na ho siwaye kuch ke jo main qarz ke liye rok lun."
"5291","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar wo Musalman hota aur tum us ki taraf se azaad karte, us ki taraf se sadqa dete ya us ki taraf se hajj karte to use pahunchta."
"5292","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar duniya Allah ke nazdeek machchar ke par ke barabar hoti to wo kafir ko us mein se pani ka ghoont na pilata."
"5293","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar aik surat hoti to logon ko kafi hoti."
"5294","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main kisi ko hukm deta ke kisi ko sajda kare to aurat ko hukm deta ke apne shohar ko sajda kare."
"5295","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main kisi ko hukm deta ke ghair-Allah ko sajda kare to aurat ko hukm deta ke apne shohar ko sajda kare. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, aurat apne Rab ka haq ada nahi karti yahan tak ke apne shohar ka poora haq ada kare; yahan tak ke agar wo use apne aap se mange halanke wo kajave par ho to wo use na roke."
"5296","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main zameen walon mein se kisi ko dost banata to Ibn Abi Quhafa ko dost banata; lekin tumhare saathi Allah ke dost hain."
"5297","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main apne Rab ke siwa apni ummat mein se kisi ko dost banata to Abu Bakr ko dost banata; lekin wo mere bhai aur saathi hain."
"5298","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main dost banata to Abu Bakr ko dost banata; lekin wo mere bhai aur saathi hain; aur Allah ne tumhare saathi ko dost banaya hai."
"5299","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum Bathaan se bharte to zyada na karte."
"5300","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main use galay na lagata to wo qayamat ke din tak rota rehta."
"5301","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum gunah na karte to Allah taala aisi qaum le aata jo gunah karti taake unhein bakhsh de."
"5302","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum use na chhorte to us mein se khate aur wo tumhein kafi hota."
"5303","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum gunah na karte to mujhe tum par us se darr hota jo is se bara hai: khud-pasandi khud-pasandi."
"5304","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar duniya mein se siwaye aik din ke kuch baaqi na rahe to Allah us din ko lamba karega yahan tak ke us mein mere ahle bait mein se aik shakhs ko uthayega jis ka naam mere naam ke muwafiq aur jis ke baap ka naam mere baap ke naam ke muwafiq hoga; wo zameen ko insaf aur adl se bhar dega jaise wo zulm aur na-insafi se bhari thi."
"5305","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar zamane mein se siwaye aik din ke kuch baaqi na rahe to Allah mere ahle bait mein se aik shakhs ko bhejega jo use adl se bhar dega jaise wo zulm se bhari thi."
"5306","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar koi qabar ke dabao se bachta to Saad bin Muaz bachte; unhein dabao hua phir un se khulasa hua."
"5307","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar koi qabar ke dabao se bachta to ye bachcha bachta."
"5308","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Musa utarte aur tum un ki pairwi karte aur mujhe chhor dete to gumrah ho jate; main nabiyon mein se tumhara hissa hun aur tum ummaton mein se mera hissa ho."
"5309","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe darr na hota ke wo sadqe mein se hai to use kha leta."
"5310","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansaar mein se aik shakhs hota; aur agar log wadi ya ghaati mein chalte to main Ansaar ki wadi aur ghaati mein chalta."
"5311","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansaar mein se aik shakhs hota; aur agar log wadi ya ghaati mein chalte to main Ansaar ke saath hota."
"5312","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe mominon par mushkil ka darr na hota to unhein Isha moakkhar karne aur har namaz ke waqt miswak ka hukm deta."
"5313","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe apni ummat par mushkil ka darr na hota to unhein hukm deta ke Isha ko raat ke teesre ya nisf tak moakkhar karein."
"5314","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe apni ummat par mushkil ka darr na hota to unhein hukm deta ke use aise parhein, yani Isha aadhi raat."
"5315","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe apni ummat par mushkil ka darr na hota to unhein har namaz ke waqt miswak ka hukm deta."
"5316","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe apni ummat par mushkil ka darr na hota to unhein har namaz ke waqt miswak ka hukm deta aur Isha ko raat ke teesre tak moakkhar karta."
"5317","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe apni ummat par mushkil ka darr na hota to unhein har wuzu ke saath miswak ka hukm deta."
"5318","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe apni ummat par mushkil ka darr na hota to unhein har namaz ke waqt wuzu aur har wuzu ke saath miswak ka hukm deta."
"5319","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mujhe apni ummat par mushkil ka darr na hota to un par wuzu ke saath miswak farz karta aur aakhri Isha ko aadhi raat tak moakkhar karta."
"5320","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar ye na hota ke safeer qatl nahi kiye jate to tum donon ki gardanein maar deta."
"5321","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar ye na hota ke kutte ummaton mein se aik ummat hain to unhein qatl karne ka hukm deta; pas un mein se har gehray siyah ko qatl karo. Aur jo ghar wala kutta bandhe us ke amal mein se har din qiraat kam hota hai siwaye shikar ke kutte, kheti ke kutte ya bakriyon ke kutte ke."
"5322","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar ye na hota ke kutte ummaton mein se aik ummat hain to un sab ko qatl karne ka hukm deta; pas un mein se gehray siyah ko qatl karo."
"5323","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar ye na hota ke log kufr se naye hain aur mere paas kharche mein se utna nahi jo us ki imaarat par qaabu rakhe to main us mein Hijr mein se paanch haath dakhil karta aur us ke liye darwaza banata jis se log dakhil hon aur darwaza jis se niklein."
"5324","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar ye na hota ke Safiya apne dil mein payegi to use chhor deta yahan tak ke aafiyat use kha le yahan tak ke un ke paiton se uthaya jaye, yani Hamza."
"5325","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar ye na hota ke tum dafn na karo ge to main Allah se dua karta ke tumhein qabar ka azaab sunaye."
"5326","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tumhari qaum jahiliyyat se nayi na hoti to Kaaba ko gira deta aur us ke liye do darwaze banata."
"5327","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tumhari qaum jahiliyyat se nayi ehad wali na hoti to Kaaba ke khazane ko Allah ki raah mein kharch karta, us ka darwaza zameen par banata aur us mein Hijr mein se dakhil karta."
"5328","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum Rasool na hote to tumhari gardan maar deta."
"5329","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum gunah na karte to Allah aisi makhlooq paida karta jo gunah karti aur wo unhein bakhsh deta."
"5330","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Bani Israel na hote to khana kharab na hota aur gosht sadta na; aur agar Hawwa na hotin to koi aurat apne shohar se khayanat na karti."
"5331","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tumhari qaum ka kufr se ehad naya na hota to Baitullah ko tor kar Ibrahim ki bunyad par banata aur us ke liye peeche darwaza banata; kyunke Quraish ne jab Baitullah banaya to chhota kar diya."
"5332","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar kamzor ki kamzori aur beemar ki beemari na hoti to Isha ki namaz moakkhar karta."
"5333","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Allah ki kitab mein jo guzar chuka wo na hota to mera aur us ka muamla hota."
"5334","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Hajr ko jahiliyyat ki gandagiyon ne na chhua hota to use koi beemar na chhuta magar shifa pata; aur zameen par jannat mein se us ke siwa kuch nahi."
"5335","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar logon ko un ke dawe par diya jata to log mardon ke khoon aur maal ka dawa karte; lekin qasam mudda-alaih par hai."
"5336","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar wo janta jo khara ho kar peeta hai us ke pait mein kiya hai to qai karta."
"5337","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar namazi ke saamne se guzarne wala janta ke us par kiya hai to us ka chalis khara rehna us ke liye us ke saamne se guzarne se behtar hota."
"5338","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar momin janta jo Allah ke paas saza mein se hai to koi jannat mein tama na karta; aur agar kafir janta jo Allah ke paas rehmat mein se hai to koi jannat se mayoos na hota."
"5339","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar log jante jo azaan aur pehli saff mein hai phir us par qura ke siwa na pate to qura dalte; aur agar jante jo jaldi aane mein hai to us ki taraf sabqat karte; aur agar jante jo Isha aur Subah mein hai to un donon mein aate agarche ghisat-te hue."
"5340","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar log jante jo Isha ki namaz aur Fajr ki namaz mein hai to un donon mein aate agarche ghisat-te hue."
"5341","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar log tanhayi mein se wo jante jo main janta hun to sawaar raat ko akele safar na karta."
"5342","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar mangne wala janta ke us ke liye us mein kiya hai to na mangta."
"5343","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat par zaroor aayega jo Bani Israel par aaya jooti ke jooti ke barabar....., aur beshak Bani Israel bahattar millaton par bati aur meri ummat tihattar millaton par bategi; sab aag mein siwaye aik millat ke: jo main aur mere sahaba par hain."
"5344","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon par zamana zaroor aayega jab aadmi parwa nahi karega ke maal kis se liya? Halal se ya haram se?"
"5345","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon par zamana zaroor aayega jab aadmi us mein sone ke sadqe ke saath phirega phir koi na payega jo us se le; aur aik mard dikhega jis ke peeche chalis auratein hon jo us se lipti hon mardon ki kami aur auraton ki zyadati se."
"5346","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye pathar qayamat ke din zaroor aayega jis ki do aankhein hongi jin se wo dekhega aur zaban hogi jis se wo bolega; wo us ki gawahi dega jis ne use haq se chhua."
"5347","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har shakhs apni oontni ka sar pakre; kyunke ye manzil hai jis mein hamare paas shaitan hazir hua."
"5348","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik apne dayen se khaye, apne dayen se piye aur apne dayen se le; kyunke shaitan apne bayen se khata hai, apne bayen se peeta hai, apne bayen se deta hai aur apne bayen se leta hai."
"5349","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har shakhs apni qurbani mein se khaye."
"5350","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari imamat wo kare jo tum mein Quran sab se zyada parhne wala ho."
"5351","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ghar par lashkar zaroor iman layega jo us par jihad karega; yahan tak ke jab wo zameen ke khule maidan mein honge to un ke darmiyan dhansa diya jayega; un ke awwal un ke aakhir ko pukarega phir unhein dhansa diya jayega; phir siwaye bhagne wale ke koi baaqi nahi rahega jo un ki khabar de."
"5352","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hazir ghair-hazir tak pahunchaye."
"5353","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara hazir tumhare ghair-hazir tak pahunchaye: Fajr ke baad do sajdon ke siwa namaz na parho."
"5354","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se qaumein raat khane, behuda-goi aur khel mein guzareingi phir subah bandar aur khinzeer banayi jayengi."
"5355","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik shukr-guzar dil, zikr karne wali zaban aur momin biwi ikhtiyar kare jo use aakhirat ke muamle mein madad kare."
"5356","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apne gehun ke saa mein se sadqa de aur apne khajoor ke saa mein se sadqa de."
"5357","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik apna chehra aag se bachaye agarche khajoor ke aadhe tukre se."
"5358","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik amal mein utni takleef kare jitni taqat rakhe; kyunke Allah taala nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao. Aur darmiyani raah ikhtiyar karo aur durust raho."
"5359","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumein tamanna karengi kaash wo gunaahon se zyada karte jin ke gunaahon ko Allah azza wa jal ne nekiyon se badal diya."
"5360","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumein tamanna karengi kaash is muamle ke liye wo Surayya se gire hote aur unhon ne kisi cheez ki zimmedari na li hoti."
"5361","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yaajooj aur Maajooj ke nikalne ke baad is ghar ka hajj aur umrah zaroor kiya jayega."
"5362","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se qaumein aag se meri shafaat se zaroor niklegi jise Jahannami kaha jayega."
"5363","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik shakhs ki shafaat se jo Nabi nahi do qabeelon jaisi jannat mein zaroor dakhil hogi: Rabi'a aur Mudar. Main wahi kehta hun jo kehta hun."
"5364","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se aik shakhs ki shafaat se Bani Tameem se zyada jannat mein zaroor dakhil honge."
"5365","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se sattar hazaar ya saat laakh jannat mein zaroor dakhil honge jo aapas mein mile hue honge, un mein se baaz baaz ka haath pakre hue; un ka awwal dakhil nahi hoga yahan tak ke un ka aakhir dakhil ho jaye. Un ke chehre chaudi raat ke chand ki surat par honge."
"5366","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se sattar hazaar jannat mein zaroor dakhil honge jin par na hisab hai na azaab; har hazaar ke saath sattar hazaar."
"5367","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo us ki taraf ruju kare phir use rok rakhe yahan tak ke wo paak ho phir haiz aaye aur paak ho; phir agar use talaq dene ka irada ho to paak haalat mein talaq de is se pehle ke use chhue. Yehi wo muddat hai jis ka Allah ne hukm diya hai ke auraton ko us ke liye talaq di jaye."
"5368","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere sahaba mein se log hauz par mere paas zaroor aayenge; yahan tak ke jab main unhein dekhunga aur pehchanunga to wo mujh se chheen liye jayenge. To main kahunga: Ae Rab, mere sahaba mere sahaba! To mujh se kaha jayega: Tum nahi jante jo unhon ne tumhare baad nikala."
"5369","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Allah se zyada taareef ko pasand karne wala nahi aur na koi Allah se zyada uzr qabool karne wala hai."
"5370","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Allah taala se zyada suni hui takleef par sabr karne wala nahi; wo us ke liye beta pukarte hain aur us ke liye shareek banate hain, aur wo us ke bawajood unhein aafiyat deta hai aur rizq deta hai."
"5371","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek momin se behtar koi nahi jo Islam mein umar guzare us ki takbeer, tahmeed, tasbeeh aur tahleel ke liye."
"5372","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se koi jo teen betiyon ya teen behnon ki parwarish kare aur un se ehsan kare magar wo us ke liye aag se parda hongi."
"5373","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabar dekhne ki tarah nahi."
"5374","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabar dekhne ki tarah nahi: beshak Allah taala ne Musa ko khabar di jo un ki qaum ne bachhre mein kiya to unhon ne takhtiyan na phenki; phir jab unhon ne dekha jo unhon ne kiya to takhtiyan phenk dein aur wo toot gayin."
"5375","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehelwan pachharne wala nahi; pehelwan to wo hai jo ghusse ke waqt apne aap par qaabu rakhe."
"5376","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roza khane aur peene se nahi; roza to behuda-goi aur fahhash-goi se hai. Phir agar koi tumhein gaali de ya tum par jahalat kare to kaho ke main rozedar hun, main rozedar hun."
"5377","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghina samaan ki kasrat se nahi; lekin ghina dil ka ghina hai."
"5378","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fajr ufuq mein lambi safedi nahi hai, lekin wo aarzi surkhi hai."
"5379","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jhoota wo nahi jo logon ke darmiyan sulah kare aur bhalayi pahunchaye aur bhalayi kahe."
"5380","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin wo nahi jis ke parosi us ki shararton se aman na payen."
"5381","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin taana dene wala, lanat karne wala, fahhash aur bad-zaban nahi."
"5382","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin wo nahi jo pait bhar kar khaye aur us ka parosi us ke pehlu mein bhooka ho."
"5383","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Miskeen wo nahi jise aik ya do luqme wapas karein; lekin miskeen wo hai jis ke paas ghina nahi aur wo haya karta hai aur logon se chipat kar nahi mangta."
"5384","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Miskeen wo nahi jo logon par phire aur use aik ya do luqme, aik ya do khajoorein wapas karein; lekin miskeen wo hai jo ghina na paye jo use ghani kare, na samjha jaye ke us par sadqa kiya jaye aur na khara ho ke logon se mange."
"5385","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Milane wala badla dene wala nahi; lekin milane wala wo hai jab us ka rehem toote to use jore."
"5386","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par apne ghar walon par halka nahi; agar chaho to tumhare paas saat rahoonga aur apni biwiyon ke liye saat rahoonga; aur agar chaho to teen karunga phir daura karunga."
"5387","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin nahi wo jis ke parosi us ki shararton se aman na payen."
"5388","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bande aur shirk ke darmiyan namaz chhorne ke siwa kuch nahi; phir jab use chhore to us ne shirk kiya."
"5389","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere aur Isa ke darmiyan koi Nabi nahi; aur wo utarne wale hain. Phir jab tum unhein dekho to pehchano: darmiyane qad surkhi aur safedi ki taraf maail shakhs; do rangay hue kapron mein utrenge goya un ka sar tapak raha ho agarche unhein geelapan na pahuncha ho. Phir wo logon se Islam par ladenge; saleeb torenge, khinzeer qatl karenge, jizya rakhenge; aur Allah un ke zamane mein Islam ke siwa tamam millatein halak karega; aur Maseeh Dajjal halak hoga. Phir wo zameen mein chalis saal thehrenge phir wafat payenge aur Musalman un par namaz parhenge."
"5390","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meezan mein husn-e-akhlaq se bhari koi cheez nahi."
"5391","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi cheez nahi jis mein Allah taala ki itaat ki jaye jo rehem jorne se sawab mein jaldi ho; aur koi cheez nahi jo zulm, rehem torne aur jhooti qasam se saza mein jaldi ho jo gharon ko veeran chhor deti hai."
"5392","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ke nazdeek dua se izzat wali koi cheez nahi."
"5393","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi cheez nahi magar wo Allah taala ki Ibn Adam se zyada itaat-guzar hai."
"5394","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi cheez apne hazaar jaisi se behtar nahi siwaye insaan ke."
"5395","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Insaan mein se koi cheez nahi magar bosida hoti hai siwaye aik haddi ke jo dumchi ki haddi hai; aur usi se qayamat ke din takhleeq jori jayegi."
"5396","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jism mein se koi cheez nahi magar wo zaban ki tezabi ki shikayat karti hai."
"5397","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare baap par aaj ke baad takleef nahi."
"5398","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi par talaq nahi jis ka wo maalik na ho, azaadi nahi jis ka wo maalik na ho aur bea nahi jis ka wo maalik na ho."
"5399","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pani par janabat nahi."
"5400","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Uchakne wale par haath kaatna nahi."
"5401","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman par us ke ghulam aur ghore mein sadqa nahi."
"5402","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lootne wale, uchakne wale aur khain par haath kaatna nahi."
"5403","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton par mundwana nahi; auraton par to katwana hai."
"5404","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi par mannat nahi jis ka wo maalik na ho; momin par lanat us ke qatl ki tarah hai; jo apne aap ko kisi cheez se qatl kare us se qayamat ke din azaab diya jayega; jo Islam ke siwa millat se jhooti qasam khaye wo jaisa kahe waisa hai; aur jo momin par kufr ki tuhmat lagaye wo us ke qatl ki tarah hai."
"5405","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musafir par juma nahi."
"5406","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zina ke bachche par us ke walidain ke gunah mein se kuch nahi."
"5407","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us par ghusl nahi yahan tak ke utre jaise mard par ghusl nahi yahan tak ke utre."
"5408","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par apne mayyat ke ghusl mein ghusl nahi jab tum use ghusl do; kyunke tumhara mayyat napak nahi; pas tumhein kafi hai ke apne haath dho lo."
"5409","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auqaas mein kuch nahi."
"5410","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein duniya mein se kuch nahi siwaye naamon ke."
"5411","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabziyon mein zakaat nahi."
"5412","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghoron aur ghulamon mein zakaat nahi siwaye ghulamon mein fitre ki zakaat ke."
"5413","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghulam mein sadqa nahi siwaye fitre ke sadqe ke."
"5414","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maamuma mein qisas nahi."
"5415","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Neend mein kotahi nahi; kotahi to jaagne mein hai ke namaz moakkhar kare yahan tak ke doosri namaz ka waqt dakhil ho jaye."
"5416","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch wasaq khajoor se kam mein sadqa nahi, paanch oonton se kam mein sadqa nahi aur paanch ooqiya chandi se kam mein sadqa nahi."
"5417","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch wasaq khajoor ya anaaj se kam mein sadqa nahi."
"5418","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch oonton se kam mein sadqa nahi; chaar mein kuch nahi. Phir jab paanch tak pahunche to us mein aik bakri hai jab tak nau tak pahunche; phir jab das tak pahunche to us mein do bakriyan hain jab tak chauda tak pahunche; phir jab pandrah tak pahunche to us mein teen bakriyan hain jab tak unnees tak pahunche; phir jab bees tak pahunche to us mein chaar bakriyan hain jab tak chaubees tak pahunche; phir jab pachees tak pahunche to us mein makhaz ki beti hai paintis tak; phir agar makhaz ki beti na ho to laboon ka nar beta. Phir agar aik oont zyada ho jaye to us mein laboon ki beti hai jab tak paintalis tak pahunche; phir agar aik oont zyada ho jaye to us mein hiqqa hai jab tak saath tak pahunche; phir agar aik oont zyada ho jaye to us mein jaza hai jab tak pichhattar tak pahunche; phir agar aik oont zyada ho jaye to us mein laboon ki do betiyan hain jab tak nabbe tak pahunche; phir agar aik oont zyada ho jaye to us mein do hiqqe hain jab tak aik sau bees tak pahunche; phir har pachaas mein hiqqa aur har chalis mein laboon ki beti hai."
"5419","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ko kisi par fazilat nahi siwaye deen ya naik amal ke; aadmi ke liye kafi hai ke wo fahhash bad-zaban bakheel buzdil ho."
"5420","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qatil ke liye meeras nahi."
"5421","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qatil ke liye kuch nahi; aur agar us ka koi waris na ho to us ka waris us se qareeb tareen log hain; aur qatil kuch wirasat nahi payega."
"5422","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qatil ke liye meeras mein se kuch nahi."
"5423","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ka koi shareek nahi."
"5424","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurat ke liye apne maal mein se kuch kharch karna jayez nahi siwaye apne shohar ki ijazat se."
"5425","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton ke liye raaste ka darmiyan nahi."
"5426","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamare liye buri misaal nahi; apne tohfe mein wapas lene wala kutte ki tarah hai jo apni qai mein wapas aata hai."
"5427","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye jayez nahi ke naqsh-o-nigar wale ghar mein dakhil hun."
"5428","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safar mein roza neki mein se nahi."
"5429","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safar mein roza neki mein se nahi; pas tum par Allah ki ruksat hai jo us ne tumhein di hai; use qabool karo."
"5430","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi sheher nahi magar Dajjal use raundega siwaye Makka aur Madina ke; aur un ke raston mein se koi raasta nahi magar us par farishte gheray hue pehra de rahe hain. Phir wo khaari zameen mein utrega aur Madina apne walon sameet teen baar hilega; us mein se har kafir aur munafiq us ki taraf nikal jayega."
"5431","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne baap ke siwa aur ki taraf mansub ho halanke wo janta ho us ne kufr kiya; aur jo wo dawa kare jo us ka nahi wo ham mein se nahi; wo aag mein apni jagah bana le. Aur jo kisi shakhs ko kufr se pukare ya kahe Allah ka dushman halanke wo aisa na ho magar us par lautega. Aur koi shakhs kisi shakhs par fisq ki tuhmat na lagaye na us par kufr ki tuhmat lagaye magar us par lautegi agar us ka saathi aisa na ho."
"5432","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Din ka koi amal nahi magar us par muhar lagayi jati hai; phir jab momin beemar ho to farishte kehte hain: Ae hamare Rab, tera falan banda rok diya gaya hai. To Rab farmata hai: Us ke liye us ke amal jaisa muhar karo yahan tak ke wo sehat paye ya mar jaye."
"5433","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo auraton mein mardon se mushabehat kare na jo mardon mein auraton se mushabehat kare."
"5434","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo hamare siwa se mushabehat kare; Yahudiyon se mushabehat na karo na Nasraniyon se; kyunke Yahudiyon ka salam ungliyon se ishara hai aur Nasraniyon ka salam hatheliyon se ishara hai."
"5435","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo bad-shaguni le ya jis ke liye li jaye, kahaanat kare ya karwaye, jadu kare ya karwaye."
"5436","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo amanat se halaf le; aur jo kisi ki biwi ya ghulam ko bigare wo ham mein se nahi."
"5437","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo aurat ko us ke shohar par ya ghulam ko us ke aaqa par bigare."
"5438","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo cheekhe, munde aur phaare."
"5439","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo hamare siwa ki sunnat par amal kare."
"5440","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo dhoka de."
"5441","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo rukhsar peete, gireban phaare aur jahiliyyat ki pukaar pukare."
"5442","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo Quran ko khush-aawazi se na parhe."
"5443","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo hamare bare ki taazeem na kare, hamare chhote par rehem na kare aur hamare aalim ka haq na pehchane."
"5444","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo hamare chhote par rehem na kare aur hamare bare ka sharaf na pehchane."
"5445","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo hamare chhote par rehem na kare aur hamare bare ki taazeem na kare."
"5446","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat wale kisi cheez par hasrat nahi karenge siwaye us ghari par jo un par guzri jis mein unhon ne Allah azza wa jal ka zikr nahi kiya."
"5447","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qehet ye nahi ke baarish na ho; lekin qehet ye hai ke baarish ho aur baarish ho aur zameen kuch na ugaye."
"5448","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik har cheez mein wapas aaye yahan tak ke apni jooti ke tasme mein; kyunke wo museebaton mein se hai."
"5449","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik miswak ki lakri se logon se be-niyaz ho."
"5450","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sawaar paidal ko salam kare, paidal baithe ko salam kare aur kam zyada ko salam kare. Phir jo salam ka jawab de wo us ke liye hai aur jo jawab na de us ke liye kuch nahi."
"5451","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qahtan mein se aadmi logon ko laathi se zaroor hankega."
"5452","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Giroh qurbani mein shareek hon."
"5453","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se log sharab zaroor piyenge jise wo us ke naam ke siwa naam denge."
"5454","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se log sharab zaroor piyenge jise wo us ke naam ke siwa naam denge; un ke saron par baaje aur gaane waliyan bajengi; Allah unhein zameen mein dhansa dega aur un mein se bandar aur khinzeer banayega."
"5455","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik apni chusti mein namaz parhe; phir jab sust ya thaka hua ho to baith jaye."
"5456","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi us masjid mein namaz parhe jo us se mili hui ho aur masjdon ke peeche na jaye."
"5457","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ko aag ki siyahi zaroor pahunchegi un gunaahon ki saza jo unhon ne kiye phir Allah unhein apni rehmat ke fazl se jannat mein dakhil karega; unhein Jahannami kaha jayega."
"5458","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik apne saamne oont ke kajave ke pichhle hisse jaisa rakhe; aur use nuqsan nahi jo us ke saamne se guzre."
"5459","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman apni museebaton mein mujh par museebat se taaziyat lein."
"5460","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad meri ummat par andheri raat ke tukron jaise fitne zaroor aayenge; aadmi us mein subah momin hoga aur shaam kafir; qaumein apna deen duniya ki thori qeemat par bechengi."
"5461","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Log Dajjal se paharon mein zaroor bhaagenge."
"5462","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Maryam Dajjal ko Bab-e-Ludd par zaroor qatl karenge."
"5463","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se log Quran zaroor parhenge jo Islam se aise niklenge jaise teer shikar se nikalta hai."
"5464","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik ke liye duniya mein se khadim aur sawari kafi ho."
"5465","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se aadmi ke liye sawaar ke zadd-e-raah jaisa kafi ho."
"5466","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein qaumein zaroor hongi jo khazz, resham, sharab aur baaje halal karengi; aur qaumein pahar ke pehlu mein utrengi; un ke maweshi un ke paas shaam ko aayenge; un ke paas aane wala apni hajat ke liye aayega to wo us se kahenge: Kal hamare paas wapas aao. Phir Allah unhein bhejega aur pahar un par girega; aur un mein se aakhiron ko qayamat ke din tak bandar aur khinzeer banayega."
"5467","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat mein dhansna, pathraao aur surat badalna zaroor hoga; aur ye jab wo sharab piyenge, gaane waliyan ikhtiyar karenge aur baaje bajayenge."
"5468","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis raat mujhe sairaan karayi gayi maine Musa ko dekha; wo darmiyane qad ke shakhs thay goya Shanua ke mardon mein se. Aur maine Isa ko dekha; wo darmiyane qad surkh thay goya hammam se nikle hon. Aur maine Ibrahim ko dekha aur main un ki aulad mein un se zyada mushabeh hun. Phir mere paas do bartan laye gaye; un mein se aik mein doodh tha aur doosre mein sharab; phir mujh se kaha gaya: Piyo jo chaho. Phir maine doodh liya aur piya. Phir mujh se kaha gaya: Tum ne fitrat ko paya; khabardar, agar tum sharab lete to tumhari ummat gumrah ho jati."
"5469","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis raat mujhe sairaan karayi gayi main farishton ki kisi majlis par nahi guzra magar unhon ne mujhe pachhne lagwane ka hukm diya."
"5470","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mehman ki raat har Musalman par haq hai; phir jo subah mehman us ke sehan mein ho wo us par us ke liye qarz hai; agar chahe taqaza kare aur agar chahe chhor de."
"5471","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Laila-tul-Qadr aakhri ashray mein hai, panchwein ya teesre mein."
"5472","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Laila-tul-Qadr roshan raat hai, na garam na thandi،.......... us mein sitara nahi phenka jata; aur us ke din ki nishani mein suraj baghair shua ke tuloo hota hai."
"5473","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Laila-tul-Qadr saat ya untees ki raat hai; beshak farishte us raat zameen mein kankariyon ki tadaad se zyada hain."
"5474","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Laila-tul-Qadr sattais ki raat hai."
"5475","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Laila-tul-Qadr narm khuli raat hai, na garam na thandi; us ki subah suraj kamzor surkh tuloo hota hai."
"5476","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se aqal aur danish wale mujh se mile hon, phir jo un se mile hon, phir jo un se mile hon. Aur ikhtilaf na karo warna tumhare dil mukhtalif ho jayenge; aur bazaaron ke shor se bacho."
"5477","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har do mardon mein se aik zaroor bheja jayega aur ajr un donon ke darmiyan hai."
"5478","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam girah girah zaroor tootega."
"5479","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumein namaz mein dua ke waqt apni nazrein aasman ki taraf uthane se zaroor baaz aayen warna un ki nazrein uchak li jayengi."
"5480","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumein juma chhorne se zaroor baaz aayen warna Allah un ke dilon par muhar laga dega phir wo ghaafilon mein se honge."
"5481","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumein namaz mein apni nazrein aasman ki taraf uthane se zaroor baaz aayen warna un ki nazrein un ki taraf wapas na aayengi."
"5482","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumein apne mare hue baapon par fakhr karne se zaroor baaz aayen; wo to jahannam ka koyla hain; ya wo Allah ke nazdeek us gubrila keede se zyada haqeer honge jo gobar ko apni naak se dhakelta hai. Beshak Allah ne tum se jahiliyyat ki nakhwat aur baapon par fakhr door kar diya hai; wo to momin muttaqi ya badkaar bad-bakht hai. Log sab Bani Adam hain aur Adam mitti se paida kiye gaye."
"5483","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apne bhai ki madad zaroor kare, zaalim ho ya mazloom. Agar zaalim ho to use roke; kyunke ye us ke liye madad hai. Aur agar mazloom ho to us ki madad kare."
"5484","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aafiyat wale qayamat ke din tamanna karenge kaash un ki khaalein qainchiyon se kaati jatin jab wo aazmaish walon ka sawab dekhenge."
"5485","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi tamanna karega kaash wo Surayya se gira hota aur us ne logon ke muamle mein se kuch zimmedari na li hoti."
"5486","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qareeb hai ke aadmi tamanna kare kaash wo Surayya se gira hota aur us ne logon ke muamle mein se kuch zimmedari na li hoti."
"5487","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maaldaar ka taal-matol us ki izzat aur saza ko halal karta hai."
"5488","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khwab mein doodh fitrat hai."
"5489","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lahad hamare liye hai aur shaq hamare siwa ke liye hai."
"5490","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lahad hamare liye hai aur shaq ahle kitab mein se hamare siwa ke liye hai."
"5491","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis se Asr ki namaz choot jaye goya us ke ghar wale aur maal chheen liye gaye."
"5492","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apna ruku mukammal na kare aur apne sajde mein thong mare wo bhooke ki tarah hai jo aik ya do khajoorein khaye jo use kuch faida na dein."
"5493","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo witr parhe baghair na soye wo danishmand hai."
"5494","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne aap ka gala ghonte wo use aag mein ghont-ta hai; aur jo use neza mare wo use aag mein marta hai."
"5495","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo baghair hajat ke mange wo us ki tarah hai jo angara uthaye."
"5496","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chandi ke bartan mein peeta hai wo apne pait mein jahannam ki aag gar-garata hai."
"5497","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Quran parhe halanke wo us mein mahir hai wo izzat wale naik safiron ke saath hai; aur jo use parhe halanke wo us par mushkil hai us ke liye do ajr hain."
"5498","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khel teen mein hai: apne ghore ko sikhana, apni kaman se teer marna aur apne ghar walon se khelna."
